#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3.4 Optimization Stage {#34-optimization-stage}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The last default stage in the pipeline is optimization. After we've embedded"
" the circuit for the target the circuit has expanded quite a bit. Most of "
"this is due to inefficiencies in the equivalence relationships from basis "
"translation and swap insertion. The optimization stage is used to try and "
"minimize the size and depth of the circuit. It runs a series of passes in a "
"```do while``` loop until it reaches a steady output.\n"
msgstr ""

